From ef052f989e96e5027bd3cbabc9712f43ed2c888e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Satoshi Ikeuchi <satosan.ikm@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:37:14 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: ipq9574: disable WCSS reservation by
 default

The WCSS remote processor is disabled by default, but its Q6 memory
region is still reserved on boards that do not use the integrated radio.
Disable the reservation by default too. Boards that use WCSS can enable
the reservation alongside the remote processor.

Link: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/25595#issuecomment-6716314055
Signed-off-by: Satoshi Ikeuchi <satosan.ikm@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq9574.dtsi
@@ -232,6 +232,7 @@
 		q6_region: wcss@4ab00000 {
 			reg = <0x0 0x4ab00000 0x0 0x2b00000>;
 			no-map;
+			status = "disabled";
 		};
 	};
 
